Project: ARC (Audio/Alternate Reality Construct)

Core Philosophy:
- Live interactive theater.
- Director controls pacing.
- AI are actors, not directors.
- Human actors can replace AI actors.
- Low friction web-first architecture.

Tech Stack:
- TypeScript
- Three.js
- WebXR
- Node.js
- WebSockets
- WebRTC
- React
- OpenAI Realtime API
- ElevenLabs
- Stream Deck integration

Coding Style:
- Prefer composition over inheritance.
- Strong TypeScript typing.
- Small focused classes.
- Fail gracefully.
- Systems should degrade rather than crash.

Architecture:
- Cue driven.
- State machines.
- Human/AI actor abstraction.
- NPC memory is scene-local.